  "difficulty_reason": "The selected map is defined through the author’s new nonconvex tile, so its well-definedness requires the complete source-local cut-flow orthogonality and coordinate-sign obstruction showing that different basis cells are disjoint modulo the sandpile lattice. The proof must also establish full lattice-translated coverage and resolve every boundary class using a generic shifting direction before identifying each fiber with a translated half-open basis parallelepiped of squared-determinant volume. This constructive global geometric multijection is substantially beyond a qualification-level determinant enumeration or a routine corollary of the matrix-tree formula.",
